POST http://localhost:8080/growdent/events/7/addUser/1
### Einladung
POST http://localhost:8080/growdent/EventGraph/inviteUser/1/toEvent/8
### Eventgraph von User 1 anzeigen lassen
GET http://localhost:8080/growdent/EventGraph/2
//Linus lustige Testrequests vom 10.07----------------------------------------------------------
###
### 1. Student anlegen
POST http://localhost:8080/growdent/users/student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Linus",
  "lastName": "Test",
  "username": "linus",
  "email": "linus@test.de",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 2. Veranstalter anlegen
POST http://localhost:8080/growdent/users/veranstalter
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Vera",
  "lastName": "Stalter",
  "username": "vera",
  "email": "vera@test.de",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 3. IDs rausfinden (type: Student / Veranstalter)
GET http://localhost:8080/growdent/users

### 4. KERNTEST: Student (ID 1) erstellt -> muss "type": "MiniEvent" liefern
POST http://localhost:8080/growdent/events/user/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Spieleabend",
  "venue": "Zuhause",
  "eventdate": "2026-07-20T19:00:00",
  "organizer": "Linus",
  "maxSlots": 6,
  "genre": "Gaming",
  "treffpunktHinweis": "Klingel bei Brinkmann, 3. Stock",
  "mitbringliste": "Snacks und Getraenke selbst mitbringen"
}

### 5. KERNTEST: Veranstalter (ID 2) erstellt -> muss "type": "VeranstalterEvent" liefern
### Exakt gleiches JSON-Format, nur andere creatorId!
POST http://localhost:8080/growdent/events/user/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sommerfest",
  "venue": "Stadthalle",
  "eventdate": "2026-08-15T18:00:00",
  "organizer": "Vera",
  "maxSlots": 300,
  "genre": "Musik",
  "ticketPreis": 12.50,
  "mindestalter": 18,
  "ticketLink": "https://tickets.bsp.de/sommerfest"
}

### Gegenprobe: Student schickt ticketpreis mit -> wird ignoriert
POST http://localhost:8080/growdent/events/user/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Schummelversuch",
  "venue": "Zuhause",
  "eventdate": "2026-07-28T19:00:00",
  "organizer": "Linus",
  "maxSlots": 4,
  "genre": "Gaming",
  "ticketPreis": 99.99,
  "mindestalter": 18
}

### 7. Alle Events - gemischte Liste mit unterschiedlichem "type"
GET http://localhost:8080/growdent/events

### 8. Einzelnes Event
GET http://localhost:8080/growdent/events/1

### 9. Teilnehmer hinzufuegen (testet, dass participantIDs nicht null ist)
POST http://localhost:8080/growdent/events/1/addUser/2

### 10. Teilnehmerliste -> [2]
GET http://localhost:8080/growdent/events/1/participantIds

### 11. Fehlerfall: nicht existierender Creator -> muss sauber fehlschlagen
POST http://localhost:8080/growdent/events/user/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Geistevent",
  "venue": "Nirgendwo",
  "eventdate": "2026-09-01T12:00:00",
  "organizer": "Niemand",
  "maxSlots": 1,
  "genre": "Test"
}

### 12. Fehlerfall: nicht existierendes Event -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/growdent/events/9999
###
### //Student verlässt Event vorzeitig wieder
DELETE http://localhost:8080/growdent/events/1/removeUser/2

//Tests für Event-Einladungen
### //Freund zu Event einladen (Event 1, Student 1 lädt Freund 2 ein)
POST http://localhost:8080/growdent/events/invitations/invite?eventId=1&inviterId=1&inviteeId=2
### //Erhaltene Einladungen eines Studenten abrufen
GET http://localhost:8080/growdent/events/invitations/received/2
### //Einladungen zu einem Event abrufen (für Event Graph)
GET http://localhost:8080/growdent/events/invitations/event/1
### //Einladung annehmen (wird Teilnehmer des Events)
PUT http://localhost:8080/growdent/events/invitations/accept?invitationId=1
### //Einladung ablehnen
DELETE http://localhost:8080/growdent/events/invitations/decline?invitationId=1
